OL,3,GNEWSATata Steel talks ongoing amid
OL,4,Areports Port Talbot electric furnace
OL,5,Afaces grid delays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Welsh secretary has said
OL,8,Fdiscussions with Tata Steel are
OL,9,Fongoing, following reports the company
OL,10,Fis seeking compensation over grid
OL,11,Fconnection delays to its new Port
OL,12,FTalbot electric arc furnace.
OL,14,FSpeaking at a Labour conference event
OL,15,Fin Liverpool, Stephen Kinnock said he
OL,16,Fwas "aware that the delays to the
OL,17,Felectric arc furnace have been very
OL,18,Fchallenging for Tata".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
