OL,3,GNEWSATata Steel talks ongoing amid
OL,4,Areports Port Talbot electric furnace
OL,5,Afaces grid delays
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said the UK government would "of
OL,8,Fcourse give careful consideration to
OL,9,Fany proposal that they might have for
OL,10,Ffinancial support".
OL,12,FBut he added that it would not be
OL,13,Fappropriate to comment on "commercial
OL,14,Fdiscussions".
